{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37722","headline":"将之泸郡旅次遂州遇裴晤员外谪居於此话旧凄凉因寄二首 一 · 郑谷","name":"将之泸郡旅次遂州遇裴晤员外谪居於此话旧凄凉因寄二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁解登高问上玄，谪仙何事谪诗仙。\n云遮列宿离华省，树荫澄江入野船。\n黄鸟晚啼愁瘴雨，青梅早落中蛮烟。\n不知几首南行曲，留与巴儿万古传。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37722.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37722","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}